This product includes software developed for ULTRON
(https://github.com/saikiran-nathani, a post-training curriculum by the same
author): src/pca/sandbox/ and src/pca/eval/ were copied from that project on
2026-11-20 and are maintained here.

They have since diverged. src/pca/sandbox/_runner.py was rewritten on 2026-11-21
after an exploit corpus measured six of ten reward hacks scoring a perfect 1.0
against the inherited design; src/pca/sandbox/executor.py was extended in the
same pass. src/pca/eval/ is still as copied.
